  "text": "The initiative is embedded in China's apex planning institution, integrating climate objectives into Five-Year Plans and major infrastructure strategies. It uses both administrative and market instruments, such as the national Emissions Trading System (ETS), to guide investment signals. The initiative also coordinates regional strategies and inter-ministerial policymaking, ensuring climate priorities are mainstreamed across development agendas.",
